          "verdict": "pass",
          "reason": "仍維持修正。source21 L13先明說raw scores優先；L126–130的selected主排序確為result[scores]，stable ID只作次序；L161真平手fixture提供equal raw scores。本人僅抽取目前selected做六個人工CPU個案，原[0,1e-8]反例及反序均選b，四個真同分例按固定ID。三段內嵌碼與本人已核source12逐byte相同，原float32機率捨入證據按舊path/SHA沿用，沒有重新跑模型。原necessary及原original的unresolved/revise時點均保留。",
          "current_evidence": [
            {
              "source_sha256": "8cd1612e8c64a6833a01cad829294da07955800139f602c08d2bb9f3ffe864a1",
              "snapshot": "docs/course-revision-20261101-c-v3/source-freeze-v20/sources/19.23.md",
              "locator": "L13、L126–130 selected()、L161 fixture",
              "source_quote": "def selected(result):\n    # softmax捨入可能讓不同分數顯示同機率，先按原始分數取最大。\n    # 原分數真正平手時才按固定ID；不可用清單位置挑第一個。\n    i = min(range(len(result[\"ids\"])), key=lambda j: (-float(result[\"scores\"][j]), result[\"ids\"][j]))\n    return result[\"ids\"][i]"
            },
